WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:03.733
Pika! Pika!

2
00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:08.033
- Wow!
- Awesome!

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.733
- The Poké Ball Factory!
- It's huge!

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.833
It's amazing to think that place is where they make Poké Balls!

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.833
I've dreamed of seeing it, and now it's happening!

6
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.666
Ah! I'm so happy!

7
00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:24.433
Try to get a hold of yourself.

8
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.666
- We've been waiting for you.
- Huh?

9
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:29.800
We welcome you to our dream factory!

10
00:00:29.866 --> 00:00:33.466
I'm the plant manager, and I'm in charge of this facility.

11
00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.700
As assistant plant manager, I'm second in charge.

12
00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:39.933
And as secretary, I'm the third wheel!

13
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.633
You're the plant manager...

14
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.933
- You're the assistant...
- Third wheel?

15
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.333
Oh, you're so smart!

16
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.166
We'd like to reward you with our premium grand tour.

17
00:00:48.233 --> 00:00:49.933
And we'll be your tour guides.

18
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.433
Lucky you.

19
00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:54.933
Wow, thanks a lot!

20
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

21
00:00:56.866 --> 00:00:58.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

22
00:00:58.633 --> 00:01:02.066
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

23
00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:03.533
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

24
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.366
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

25
00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:10.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

26
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:14.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

27
00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:18.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

28
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:22.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

29
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

30
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.333
A Frenzied Factory Fiasco!

31
00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:38.933
Our heroes are on their way to Anistar City,

32
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.033
where Ash's next Gym Battle awaits,

33
00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.000
but first, who can resist the opportunity

34
00:01:44.066 --> 00:01:48.433
for a personally guided tour of the Poké Ball Factory?

35
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.433
Hm.

36
00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.266
- Hm.
- Hm.

37
00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:53.533
- Whoa!
- Pika!

38
00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:59.266
- Wow, what an operation!
- Pika.

39
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:01.300
Look at that!

40
00:02:01.366 --> 00:02:04.333
Everything in this factory is fully automated!

41
00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.900
Of course. We use only the latest

42
00:02:06.966 --> 00:02:09.333
in cuttin'-edge production technology.

43
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.466
Fascinating!

44
00:02:11.533 --> 00:02:13.333
I wish I could see it up close!

45
00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.000
- Hm.
- Hm.

46
00:02:15.066 --> 00:02:17.966
All good things come to those who wait! Be patient.

47
00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:21.100
You'll soon see everything up close and personal.

48
00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:22.500
Are you serious?

49
00:02:22.566 --> 00:02:25.400
Of course. But first, first things first.

50
00:02:25.466 --> 00:02:27.600
We'll need to inspect all of your Poké Balls.

51
00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:28.833
Huh?

52
00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.266
- But why do you want them?
- Denne?

53
00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:32.466
I don't understand.

54
00:02:32.533 --> 00:02:36.200
Here at our factory, we offer a unique and practical service.

55
00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:38.900
We detect easy-to-miss damage to Poké Balls

56
00:02:38.966 --> 00:02:42.566
and status conditions in Pokémon and fix them perfectly.

57
00:02:42.633 --> 00:02:45.566
- And of course, there's no charge!
- Wow.

58
00:02:45.633 --> 00:02:48.766
That's just what I'd expect! I'll get mine. Hold on.

59
00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:50.033
Yeah. Me too.

60
00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.466
- Might as well, don't you think?
- Hm.

61
00:02:52.533 --> 00:02:54.900
Ne! Denne!

62
00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.333
Now please place them in this custom-made padded Poké Ball case.

63
00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.166
- There.
- Thank you!

64
00:03:04.233 --> 00:03:06.033
Ah.

65
00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.533
Mine, too.

66
00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.133
Make sure that's all of 'em.

67
00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.233
Wouldn't wanna leave one all alone, would we, now?

68
00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:24.533
One thing. You see, my Pikachu really doesn't like going inside its Poké Ball.

69
00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.766
- Pika.
- Of course not. We know that.

70
00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:29.966
Fret not! No problemo!

71
00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:33.033
Fortunately, we've got just the perfect thing.

72
00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.866
Kindly place Pikachu right in here.

73
00:03:35.933 --> 00:03:37.400
With a smile!

74
00:03:39.166 --> 00:03:42.900
- Pikachu...
- It'll only be for a little while, buddy.

75
00:03:42.966 --> 00:03:47.266
And if you don't mind, we'll take Pikachu's Poké Ball as well.

76
00:03:47.333 --> 00:03:49.966
Oh! Right!

77
00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:53.133
And now it's time for our personally guided tour of the factory!

78
00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.366
- Not yet.
- Huh?

79
00:03:54.433 --> 00:03:56.333
We have all the time in the world.

80
00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.933
We'd first like you to experience a special booth

81
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.933
that simulates what it's like for a Pokémon to be inside of a Poké Ball.

82
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.500
Uh! Like the inside of a Poké Ball?

83
00:04:05.566 --> 00:04:06.833
That sounds like fun!

84
00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.533
Yeah! Wow! Yay!

85
00:04:13.566 --> 00:04:15.300
This is quite a walk, isn't it?

86
00:04:15.366 --> 00:04:19.266
We're taking you to a place with unconventional, cutting-edge science,

87
00:04:19.333 --> 00:04:22.800
so naturally, it's located in an unconventional location!

88
00:04:22.866 --> 00:04:26.300
- Yeah? I can hardly wait!
- Hm.

89
00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.866
Please step inside!

90
00:04:31.866 --> 00:04:33.933
So this is the place?

91
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.133
It looks like an ordinary storage room to me.

92
00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.066
This is what it's like to be inside a Poké Ball?

93
00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:41.733
- Huh?

94
00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.533
What's going on?

95
00:04:48.966 --> 00:04:50.966
Prepare for trouble, we've done it again!

96
00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:53.400
And make it double, you're gullible times ten!

97
00:04:53.466 --> 00:04:55.900
To protect the world from devastation!

98
00:04:55.966 --> 00:04:58.700
To unite all people within our nation!

99
00:04:58.766 --> 00:05:01.833
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

100
00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.766
Fooling you twerps fits us like a glove!

101
00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:07.666
- Jessie!
- And James.

102
00:05:07.733 --> 00:05:10.433
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

103
00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.566
Surrender now, or prepare for a Pokémon-less fight!

104
00:05:13.633 --> 00:05:15.033
Meowth, that's right!

105
00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.866
Wobbuffet!

106
00:05:18.266 --> 00:05:19.833
- Team Rocket, it's you!
- Grrr!

107
00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:23.733
And being completely clueless proves it can only be you!

108
00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.266
We were busy confiscating all these new factory-fresh Poké Balls

109
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:30.766
and minding our own business, when you had the nerve to show up.

110
00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:33.533
Hm! So we decided stealin' Pikachu

111
00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.566
and all your other Pokémon was just what you lamebrains deserve.

112
00:05:36.633 --> 00:05:39.966
You won't get away with this! Pikachu!

113
00:05:40.033 --> 00:05:43.066
Pika! Pika?

114
00:05:43.133 --> 00:05:45.166
You dopes!

115
00:05:45.233 --> 00:05:48.066
Electricity flows in, but it doesn't flow out.

116
00:05:48.133 --> 00:05:50.466
Pikachu!

117
00:05:51.966 --> 00:05:54.200
Pika!

118
00:05:54.266 --> 00:05:55.866
Pika!

119
00:05:55.933 --> 00:05:57.833
That case keeps the zaps from zappin',

120
00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:01.433
but I didn't realise the glass is weak against physical attacks.

121
00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.933
So now you tell us!

122
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.666
Pikachu! Thunderbolt!

123
00:06:05.366 --> 00:06:08.233
Pikachu!

124
00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.466
Wobbuffet, go!

125
00:06:10.533 --> 00:06:14.233
- Wobbuffet!
- Pika!

126
00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.233
Get a load of this!

127
00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.466
Pika... Pi...

128
00:06:18.533 --> 00:06:20.966
- Man. Just hold still!
- Pika, pika.

129
00:06:21.033 --> 00:06:24.133
It's back-up time!

130
00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.233
- Pumpka!
- Inkay!

131
00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.700
Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball!

132
00:06:27.766 --> 00:06:29.266
Inkay, now use Psybeam!

133
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:31.133
Ka-ka-ka-ka-kaboo!

134
00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.566
Pika!

135
00:06:33.633 --> 00:06:34.933
Pi... Pika?

136
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.566
- Inkay!
- Pika!

137
00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:42.300
Into the ball, bub!

138
00:06:45.366 --> 00:06:46.800
Pikachu, no!

139
00:06:47.733 --> 00:06:49.300
Huh?

140
00:06:49.366 --> 00:06:51.600
- Oh! Yes!
- Wob!

141
00:06:51.666 --> 00:06:54.300
- Yes! Yeah!
- Wob! Wob!

142
00:06:54.366 --> 00:06:57.533
♪ We caught you-know-who! ♪

143
00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.866
- Thanks to you!
- Boo-hoo!

144
00:06:59.933 --> 00:07:01.366
Wobba!

145
00:07:01.433 --> 00:07:03.600
Those guys!

146
00:07:03.666 --> 00:07:05.533
Argh! Give me back Pikachu!

147
00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:07.900
Pikachu!

148
00:07:15.133 --> 00:07:19.066
Get your Poké Balls! Made fresh every day!

149
00:07:19.133 --> 00:07:22.733
These aren't just your run-of-the-mill Poké Balls, don't you know?

150
00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.066
Here's a Great Ball. An Ultra Ball!

151
00:07:25.133 --> 00:07:28.133
Dusk Ball, a Net Ball and a Premier Ball.

152
00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:31.566
- And they're all for us!
- Wobbuffet!

153
00:07:39.766 --> 00:07:41.233
Open up!

154
00:07:42.166 --> 00:07:45.733
Ah, I can't stand Team Rocket.

155
00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:48.366
Pika, pi!

156
00:07:48.433 --> 00:07:52.000
- Huh? Pikachu?
- Pika!

157
00:07:52.066 --> 00:07:55.000
Wow, Pikachu. How did you do that?

158
00:07:55.066 --> 00:07:56.833
Pika, pika.

159
00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.800
- Huh?
- Pika, pika!

160
00:07:58.866 --> 00:08:02.366
You mean... in that quick second?

161
00:08:02.433 --> 00:08:04.300
Into the ball, bub!

162
00:08:04.366 --> 00:08:06.366
Pika? Pika!

163
00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.866
Pikachu.

164
00:08:09.933 --> 00:08:11.533
Pi, pi, pi, pi, pi!

165
00:08:12.533 --> 00:08:15.600
What do you know? Good job, buddy!

166
00:08:15.666 --> 00:08:16.966
Pikachu.

167
00:08:17.033 --> 00:08:20.400
Get us out of here, Pikachu! Now use Iron Tail!

168
00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:23.533
Pikachu! Pika!

169
00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.966
- Hm? Did you hear that?
- Huh?

170
00:08:26.033 --> 00:08:28.666
- Sounded like Pikachu backwards.
- Hm?

171
00:08:28.733 --> 00:08:30.800
But I thought Pikachu's in here.

172
00:08:30.866 --> 00:08:33.900
- No good.

173
00:08:33.966 --> 00:08:38.000
- It won't budge an inch!
- Pikachu, one more time!

174
00:08:38.066 --> 00:08:39.966
Pikachu!

175
00:08:40.033 --> 00:08:41.799
Chu... Pika?

176
00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.833
Pikachu!

177
00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.833
Pikachu.

178
00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.800
Then that means...

179
00:08:56.433 --> 00:08:59.766
Hey, now! We're the ones who fool the twerps!

180
00:08:59.833 --> 00:09:01.900
-Pika!

181
00:09:01.966 --> 00:09:04.166
- Pika!
- Huh! The case! It's gone!

182
00:09:04.233 --> 00:09:05.566
They must have put it somewhere!

183
00:09:05.633 --> 00:09:06.900
- Pikachu, don't worry about us!
- Pika.

184
00:09:06.966 --> 00:09:09.000
Work on getting everyone back!

185
00:09:09.066 --> 00:09:11.900
Pika! Pi. Pika!

186
00:09:11.966 --> 00:09:14.966
Eh? Oy vey.

187
00:09:15.033 --> 00:09:18.866
- Meowth! Where's that case?
- You tell me and we'll both know!

188
00:09:18.933 --> 00:09:21.033
Find Pikachu! Now!

189
00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:25.000
Inkay! Ink!

190
00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:26.933
Ink!

191
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.333
We've got quite a catch. Let's load the load into the truck!

192
00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.933
- Will do!
- Wob.

193
00:09:33.666 --> 00:09:35.200
Wob, wob, wob.

194
00:09:37.466 --> 00:09:39.500
I'm counting on you, buddy.

195
00:09:39.566 --> 00:09:43.533
Pi, pi, pi, pi...

196
00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.766
Pikachu.

197
00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:47.566
Pika!

198
00:09:47.633 --> 00:09:50.566
Pi... pi... pika.

199
00:09:50.633 --> 00:09:52.566
Inkay! Ink!

200
00:09:52.633 --> 00:09:54.866
- Pika!
- Kay!

201
00:09:54.933 --> 00:09:57.600
- Pi.
- Kay!

202
00:09:57.666 --> 00:10:00.100
Ink! Inkay.

203
00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:03.066
Pikachu! Pi, pi, pi! Pika!

204
00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.066
Inkay! Ink...

205
00:10:08.033 --> 00:10:09.566
Pika. Pi!

206
00:10:14.566 --> 00:10:15.566
Pika...

207
00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.366
Pika! Pikachu.

208
00:10:22.433 --> 00:10:25.266
Pikachu!

209
00:10:25.333 --> 00:10:28.100
Pi-i-ka! Pi!

210
00:10:28.166 --> 00:10:31.066
Pika? Pika!

211
00:10:33.366 --> 00:10:36.433
Pika! Pikachu...

212
00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.466
-Pika! Pi!

213
00:10:41.533 --> 00:10:43.966
Pi! Pi... Pika?

214
00:10:44.033 --> 00:10:46.933
Pi... Pika!

215
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.933
Want this? Then come and get it! If you're brave enough, that is.

216
00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.600
Pikachu!

217
00:10:53.666 --> 00:10:56.733
- Pi, pi, pi, pi...
- Get ready for some fireworks.

218
00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:01.166
- Pika! Pika.
- Oh, no you don't.

219
00:11:01.233 --> 00:11:04.666
Pi! Pikachu! Pi! Pika! Pika!

220
00:11:04.733 --> 00:11:07.766
- Pika.
- Back here, bub!

221
00:11:07.833 --> 00:11:09.500
Pika. Pi, pi!

222
00:11:09.566 --> 00:11:13.200
Pi! Pika! Pi, pi! Pika!

223
00:11:13.266 --> 00:11:17.333
Pi, pi, pika! Pi, pi, pika, pika!

224
00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:21.133
- Pika?
- Let's give it the gas!

225
00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.366
-Pi! Pi!

226
00:11:23.433 --> 00:11:25.333
Pikachu!

227
00:11:27.233 --> 00:11:28.500
Pika.

228
00:11:28.566 --> 00:11:30.366
Pika, pika, pika!!

229
00:11:30.433 --> 00:11:33.100
Gotcha!

230
00:11:33.166 --> 00:11:36.333
Sheesh. Aah!

231
00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:39.600
-Pika!

232
00:11:39.666 --> 00:11:41.900
- Pika!
- Aah!

233
00:11:41.966 --> 00:11:43.600
Aaah!

234
00:11:43.666 --> 00:11:45.900
Now get back here before I get you back here!

235
00:11:45.966 --> 00:11:47.066
- Chu...
- Aaah!

236
00:11:47.133 --> 00:11:49.333
Pika!

237
00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.833
Pi! Pikachu.

238
00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:55.133
Uh!

239
00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:58.300
Why is it always me?

240
00:12:03.266 --> 00:12:04.966
Pika. Pika.

241
00:12:05.033 --> 00:12:07.966
- Pika. Pi! Pika!
- Not so fast, speedy!

242
00:12:08.033 --> 00:12:10.633
That case is all mine, see?

243
00:12:11.466 --> 00:12:14.466
- Pi!
- Paws off, pal.

244
00:12:14.533 --> 00:12:15.900
Pika!

245
00:12:15.966 --> 00:12:18.800
Your ball's waitin'!

246
00:12:18.866 --> 00:12:20.800
Pi, pi. Pikachu. Pi!

247
00:12:20.866 --> 00:12:23.533
- Aaagh! You're messin' with my balance!
- Pika!

248
00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:26.300
- Uh-oh...
- Pika.

249
00:12:26.366 --> 00:12:28.800
- Someone could get hurt really bad.
- Pi...

250
00:12:28.866 --> 00:12:31.300
-Pika!

251
00:12:31.366 --> 00:12:34.300
-Pika!

252
00:12:34.366 --> 00:12:36.800
- Eh?
- Pika...

253
00:12:36.866 --> 00:12:41.400
-Pika! Pikachu! Pika!

254
00:12:41.466 --> 00:12:44.000
Get me out of this crazy scene on the double!

255
00:12:44.066 --> 00:12:46.966
Who's that Pokémon?

256
00:12:51.066 --> 00:12:53.533
It's Staraptor!

257
00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.433
Staraptor!

258
00:12:59.033 --> 00:13:03.033
Argh! Ahh... Huh.

259
00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:08.466
- If only we had our Pokémon.
- Hm.

260
00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.166
Eh... Uh... Eh...

261
00:13:22.233 --> 00:13:23.533
-Pika.

262
00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:26.266
- I'm not doin' that again.
- Pikachu.

263
00:13:26.333 --> 00:13:28.666
Pi? Pika!

264
00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.833
Pika!

265
00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:34.533
Check out the green Pikachu!

266
00:13:36.666 --> 00:13:38.500
Pika, pika, pi!

267
00:13:38.566 --> 00:13:40.533
Why are you just hanging around?

268
00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:43.533
All the Poké Balls have been sorted and safely stored away!

269
00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:46.100
Pikachu's a tough customer!

270
00:13:46.166 --> 00:13:47.766
Pika, Pikachu!

271
00:13:47.833 --> 00:13:49.700
Hm.

272
00:13:49.766 --> 00:13:53.133
- Here we go again.
- We'll help you. Hang on. Let's go!

273
00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:56.700
Don't get up on our account. James, wait up!

274
00:13:56.766 --> 00:13:58.133
Hey! Let us go!

275
00:14:00.133 --> 00:14:03.433
Once we catch Pikachu, we can say goodbye to this dump.

276
00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.366
-Pikachu! Pika!

277
00:14:06.433 --> 00:14:09.200
You look like Wobbuffet!

278
00:14:09.266 --> 00:14:11.366
- Chic!
- Playtime's over.

279
00:14:11.433 --> 00:14:13.633
Now move! I'll take care of this.

280
00:14:13.766 --> 00:14:16.266
Pika!

281
00:14:16.333 --> 00:14:17.800
Pika!

282
00:14:22.033 --> 00:14:23.700
Pi, pika.

283
00:14:23.766 --> 00:14:26.433
Huh?

284
00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.700
I've gotta get that case. Quick-like. Eh?

285
00:14:29.766 --> 00:14:32.200
Bingo.

286
00:14:32.266 --> 00:14:35.366
Hey! Aaah! No. Not in the face!

287
00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:39.933
- That's not what we want.
- I know that!

288
00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.666
Yes! How about this?

289
00:14:41.733 --> 00:14:44.400
Argh. Ahh!

290
00:14:45.766 --> 00:14:49.666
Pi... Pi, pi, pi, Pikachu!

291
00:14:49.733 --> 00:14:53.166
- I don't need a shine!
- Pi, pika!

292
00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:57.966
- Aaah!
- Pi... Pika, pika.

293
00:14:58.033 --> 00:15:02.033
- Oh, look. They're all squeaky clean!
- Very becoming on Meowth.

294
00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:05.633
- Arghhh!
- Pika.

295
00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:08.833
- Pi, pika!

296
00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:13.233
- Clemont?
- What's wrong?

297
00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:15.333
I finally finished it!

298
00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:18.333
The future is now, thanks to science!

299
00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.633
Clemontic Gear, on!

300
00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:24.133
I call it my Extra-Strength Pry-It- Open!

301
00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:28.200
- Yeah!
- You're certain this is gonna work, right?

302
00:15:28.266 --> 00:15:31.066
No doubt! I place it here like so,

303
00:15:31.133 --> 00:15:34.200
and when I flip the switch, it'll pry open the door!

304
00:15:34.266 --> 00:15:35.733
- Huh?

305
00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:39.366
Whoa.

306
00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:44.733
- All right, just a little bit more. Huh?
- Huh? Now what?

307
00:15:50.933 --> 00:15:53.566
Wow! Science is so amazing!

308
00:15:53.633 --> 00:15:55.733
Right, it's just like I planned it.

309
00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.433
I'm coming, Pikachu!

310
00:16:03.933 --> 00:16:06.300
Pika... Pika!

311
00:16:06.366 --> 00:16:09.300
It's Poké Ball time! Aaah!

312
00:16:09.366 --> 00:16:12.566
Pika, pika!

313
00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:18.066
Hey! No one's boppin' me on the bean! Huh?

314
00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:23.466
- Give it a break, twerp!
- Pika, pi!

315
00:16:23.533 --> 00:16:26.466
Pi. Pika.

316
00:16:26.533 --> 00:16:29.233
- Pi, pi, pi, pi!
- Your freedom days are over!

317
00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:30.466
- Meowth!
- Huh?

318
00:16:30.533 --> 00:16:32.466
What are you doing?

319
00:16:32.533 --> 00:16:34.466
The twerps are now on the run!

320
00:16:34.533 --> 00:16:37.200
Grab that case and we'll meet you in the parking lot!

321
00:16:37.266 --> 00:16:38.400
Double time!

322
00:16:38.466 --> 00:16:41.800
After all that? No! Pikachu stays!

323
00:16:43.766 --> 00:16:45.300
Chu!

324
00:16:45.366 --> 00:16:47.433
Pika.

325
00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.933
- Pikachu!
- Pika.

326
00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.800
It's the end of the line!

327
00:16:51.866 --> 00:16:54.033
Pika? Pika, Pikachu!

328
00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:56.033
Unh! Aah! Huh?

329
00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:59.033
Eh? A Luxury Ball?

330
00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:05.233
-Pi, Pikachu.

331
00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.966
Such luxury! I've hit the big time.

332
00:17:10.033 --> 00:17:12.333
Eh? That pesky Pikachu almost caught me,

333
00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.400
and I couldn't feel any more humiliated!

334
00:17:14.466 --> 00:17:16.000
Now, where's that lug?

335
00:17:17.666 --> 00:17:18.500
Pika!

336
00:17:18.566 --> 00:17:22.000
- Busted.
- Pi. Pika!

337
00:17:22.066 --> 00:17:24.066
Take that. Yeah.

338
00:17:24.133 --> 00:17:25.266
- Meowth! Hurry!
- Eh?

339
00:17:25.333 --> 00:17:27.566
Forget about Pikachu!

340
00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.733
Pika!

341
00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.733
- Pikachu!
- Pika, pi...

342
00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.900
- Pikachu!
- Pika, pi!

343
00:17:36.966 --> 00:17:39.300
I was worried about you!

344
00:17:39.366 --> 00:17:41.733
- Pi, Pikachu. Pika.
- All right, let's go!

345
00:17:42.866 --> 00:17:45.466
- Hey. Hey!
- Hm? Huh?

346
00:17:45.533 --> 00:17:47.366
- Help us!
- Help!

347
00:17:47.433 --> 00:17:50.466
- Team Rocket must have done this!
- Right! Let's help them out!

348
00:17:50.533 --> 00:17:55.200
- Pikachu escaped once again.
- But we still came out ahead.

349
00:17:55.266 --> 00:17:58.200
Yeah? Well, I'm not dancin' the happy dance.

350
00:17:59.566 --> 00:18:03.933
- Where did they go?
- Pika!

351
00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.933
Huh?

352
00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.200
- Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!
- Pika!

353
00:18:14.266 --> 00:18:17.633
Pikachu!

354
00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.566
Wobbuffet.

355
00:18:30.033 --> 00:18:31.766
- Pikachu!
- Pika?

356
00:18:31.833 --> 00:18:34.266
Let's settle this once and for all!

357
00:18:34.333 --> 00:18:35.766
You want this back?

358
00:18:35.833 --> 00:18:38.266
Then you're gonna have to face me in a duel, capisce?

359
00:18:38.333 --> 00:18:40.833
- What?
- Pika, pika!

360
00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:43.000
- Are you sure, Pikachu?
- Pika.

361
00:18:43.066 --> 00:18:45.600
- Hm.
- Pi.

362
00:18:45.666 --> 00:18:49.733
Humph! OK, we're gonna use one move, and no funny business!

363
00:18:51.033 --> 00:18:52.966
Pikachu.

364
00:18:53.033 --> 00:18:54.733
You can do it, buddy!

365
00:19:02.566 --> 00:19:04.533
Get ready for my Fury Swipes!

366
00:19:05.166 --> 00:19:07.033
Chu!

367
00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.933
Ha! Fooled ya!

368
00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.733
Huh? Pika!

369
00:19:12.266 --> 00:19:14.933
Pika!

370
00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.700
Pika.

371
00:19:24.433 --> 00:19:26.433
-Pika?

372
00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.933
- Yeah, you did it!
- Pika, pi!

373
00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.433
Pika, pika!

374
00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:38.233
Team Rocket! So, you guys lost!

375
00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:41.233
Hm! What's that twerp talking about?

376
00:19:42.533 --> 00:19:44.500
Huh?

377
00:19:49.766 --> 00:19:52.500
We're blasting off again!

378
00:19:52.566 --> 00:19:54.233
Wobbuffet!

379
00:19:55.466 --> 00:19:58.900
- Hey, Ash!
- Pika!

380
00:20:03.966 --> 00:20:05.700
Come out, everybody!

381
00:20:07.033 --> 00:20:08.466
- Froga!
- Cha!

382
00:20:08.533 --> 00:20:10.166
- Noibat!
- Fletchinder!

383
00:20:10.233 --> 00:20:12.466
- Bunnelby.
- Luxray.

384
00:20:12.533 --> 00:20:14.000
- Ha-cha!
- Che!

385
00:20:14.066 --> 00:20:16.733
- Denne!
- Dedenne!

386
00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:19.000
Welcome back!

387
00:20:19.066 --> 00:20:23.500
Thanks to all your help and hard work, all our Poké Balls are safe and sound.

388
00:20:23.566 --> 00:20:26.933
That's really very nice of you. But it was definitely all Pikachu.

389
00:20:27.933 --> 00:20:30.500
- You were great, Pikachu!
- Pika.

390
00:20:30.566 --> 00:20:33.300
We'll be glad to give you a real tour of the factory.

391
00:20:33.366 --> 00:20:34.600
- Please!
- Yes!

392
00:20:34.666 --> 00:20:38.066
Yay! Yippee! Yay!

393
00:20:38.133 --> 00:20:39.633
After a false start,

394
00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:43.400
our heroes' tour of the Poké Ball Factory is about to begin!

395
00:20:43.466 --> 00:20:48.000
While the Anistar City Gym awaits, the journey continues!
